Z||000000||trigger||08-09-2000||08:54 PM||||Well, everybody else is getting together so we might as well.  I live in Dyersville, Iowa which is 30 min W of Dubuque, Iowa.  I belong to Midwest Fiero Club in Onawa, Iowa (which is on the West of the state) and Heartland Fieros (which is on the East of the state.)  Thanks for any replies.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.||||reg||1
Z||000001||LAMBO||08-10-2000||09:19 AM||||Hello Trigger, I live in Lucas which is about 1 hour south of Des Moines. I've got three babies (fieros) and would love an informal get together if time permits. By the way, I was coming home through Dubuque this weekend hauling my newest Fiero home form Wisconsin  when I spotted a white GT coming up the on ramp to 151. Needless to say, they noticed my GT on the trailer and we played cat and mouse for several miles before they exited in Dubuque. It had Wisconsin plates. Maybe you know who they were. Anyway, let me know if anything happens.<BR>LAMBO<BR>84 Indy<BR>85 SE auto<BR>86 GT 4 spd||||reg||1
Z||000002||deceler8||08-10-2000||10:00 AM||||The Midwest Fiero club is having a meeting this weekend in Lemars at the Wells Dairy museum...a long drive for the Eastern Iowa guys, though.||||reg||1
