Z||000006||Rob S||08-11-2000||12:56 AM||||You guys are killing me, how many Midwest Fiero members are on this forum? I live in Pierre SD, 350 miles from Onawa the home of Midwest Fieros. I'm happy there is a Fiero club that close to me. I won't make the ice cream cruise this week end but hope to make the annual chili feed later this year. <P>Rob Swanson<BR>Pierre, SD<BR>"one for each day of the week"<P>||||reg||1
